Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Say what to do when py is not recognised

The Python launcher ships with the python.org installer and not with the
Microsoft Store build, so `py` is missing on plenty of machines and the error
text differs between PowerShell and cmd, which makes it harder to search for.
Names both forms, says to use `python` instead, and adds a troubleshooting
table covering the failures likely to come up on a first run -- including the
quiet one, where curriculum/tut is absent and the build measures the invented
example curriculum without anybody noticing.

